{
  "meta": {},
  "name": "Monitor competitor press releases on PR TIMES and send AI summaries to Microsoft Teams",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5f00ca98-0b09-4662-982f-70042621f7bc",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -608,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 880,
        "content": "## Monitor competitor press releases on PR TIMES and send AI summaries to Microsoft Teams\n\n### How it works\n\nPR TIMES is a Japanese press release distribution service, and every company page has its own RSS feed. Every weekday morning, this workflow reads the feed of each competitor you list, keeps releases from the last 7 days, and skips any it has already processed in earlier runs. An OpenAI-powered LLM chain rates each release as high, medium, or low relevance to your topic, assigns a category, writes a short summary from the title and opening text only, and adds one line on why it matters for your product. High and medium releases are combined into one Microsoft Teams card. If nothing is relevant, nothing is sent.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- In **Prepare Competitor Settings**, list your competitors with their PR TIMES company_id (the last number in a release URL, e.g. `.../p/000000102.000019803.html` is 19803). Describe your product and topic, and choose the output language.\n- Connect your OpenAI credential to **OpenAI GPT-5 Mini**.\n- In Microsoft Teams, open the Workflows app, create \"Send webhook alerts to a chat\", and paste its webhook URL into **Post to Microsoft Teams**.\n- Run once to test, then publish.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the schedule, the number of days to look back, the relevance rules in **Analyze and Summarize Release**, the summary language, or send the digest to Slack or email instead of Teams."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "801b09e3-759c-430a-a4f6-1483fbbe470c",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -48,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Schedule and competitor setup\n\nStarts the workflow on weekday mornings, defines competitor and monitoring settings, and splits the competitor list into individual items for processing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "806dca1d-5816-4336-b9de-ab09b54890d8",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        624,
        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Fetch and clean releases\n\nReads PR TIMES RSS entries, keeps only recent press releases, and removes items that have already been processed."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d35e9870-eaad-423d-9ea0-338cd85e5e20",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1296,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 704,
        "height": 528,
        "content": "## Analyze and filter relevance\n\nUses the OpenAI chat model and structured parser inside the LLM chain to score and summarize each release, formats key release fields, and keeps only relevant results."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e7b69099-14d5-4036-b3fe-c61c722eb7f4",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        2032,
        -160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 416,
        "height": 320,
        "content": "## Compile and notify Teams\n\nAggregates all relevant releases into a single digest message and sends it to Microsoft Teams through the configured webhook."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "When Weekday Morning at 9am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "weeks",
              "triggerAtDay": [
                1,
                2,
                3,
                4,
                5
              ],
              "triggerAtHour": 9
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Prepare Competitor Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "notes": "Edit the competitor list, your product, the topic and the output language here.",
      "position": [
        224,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "competitors",
              "type": "array",
              "value": "={{ [\n  { \"name\": \"PR TIMES Inc. (example)\", \"company_id\": 112 },\n  { \"name\": \"Money Forward (example)\", \"company_id\": 8962 }\n] }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "my_product",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "An AI help desk that answers customer and employee questions from your FAQs and manuals."
            },
            {
              "id": "e1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "topic",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "AI customer support, help desks, chatbots, and internal Q&A automation"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "output_language",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "English"
            },
            {
              "id": "e1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "days_back",
              "type": "number",
              "value": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Split Competitor List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "fieldToSplitOut": "competitors"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Fetch PR TIMES Feed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.rssFeedRead",
      "position": [
        672,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://prtimes.jp/companyrdf.php?company_id={{ $json.company_id }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Filter Recent Releases",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        896,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($json.isoDate || $json.pubDate || '1970-01-01') >= $now.minus({ days: $('Prepare Competitor Settings').first().json.days_back }) }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Deduplicate Releases",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "position": [
        1120,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.link }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Analyze and Summarize Release",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "maxTries": 3,
      "position": [
        1408,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=Evaluate and summarize this press release.\n\nTopic to watch: {{ $('Prepare Competitor Settings').first().json.topic }}\nMy product: {{ $('Prepare Competitor Settings').first().json.my_product }}\nAnswer in: {{ $('Prepare Competitor Settings').first().json.output_language }}\n\nCompany: {{ $('Split Competitor List').item.json.name }}\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nOpening text: {{ $json.contentSnippet || $json.content || '' }}",
        "batching": {},
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "type": "SystemMessagePromptTemplate",
              "message": "You are a competitive intelligence analyst. You read a press release (title and opening text only) and answer in the requested language.\n\n1. relevance: how closely the release relates to the topic to watch. Use exactly one of \"high\", \"medium\", \"low\" (always in English). high = a product, feature, price, customer case, or partnership in the topic is the main subject. medium = broader news, such as general AI or automation, that is likely to affect the topic. low = unrelated, such as earnings, dividends, hiring, or unrelated products.\n2. category: one of New feature, New service, Pricing, Customer case, Partnership, Funding, Event, Research, Other, written in the requested language.\n3. summary: up to 3 short lines (about 50 words in English, or 120 characters in Japanese). Use only facts in the title and opening text, and only numbers that appear there. Skip boilerplate such as headquarters addresses or CEO names; say what happened.\n4. why_it_matters: one short line (under 20 words in English, or 60 characters in Japanese) on what this means for my product. If it is unrelated, say the direct impact is small. Do not state guesses as facts."
            }
          ]
        },
        "promptType": "define",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "OpenAI GPT-5 Mini",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "position": [
        1408,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "gpt-5-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Parse Summary Results",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "position": [
        1600,
        224
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"relevance\": { \"type\": \"string\", \"enum\": [\"high\", \"medium\", \"low\"] },\n    \"category\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"summary\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n    \"why_it_matters\": { \"type\": \"string\" }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"relevance\", \"category\", \"summary\", \"why_it_matters\"]\n}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.3
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Format Release Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1632,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "company",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Split Competitor List').item.json.name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "title",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Filter Recent Releases').item.json.title }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "link",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Filter Recent Releases').item.json.link }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "date",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ DateTime.fromISO($('Filter Recent Releases').item.json.isoDate || $('Filter Recent Releases').item.json.pubDate).setZone('Asia/Tokyo').toFormat('yyyy-MM-dd') }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "relevance",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.relevance.toLowerCase() }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "category",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.category }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "summary",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.summary }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "e2+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "name": "why_it_matters",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.output.why_it_matters }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Filter Relevant Releases",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "position": [
        1856,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "f1+1234567890-+1234567890",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ ['high', 'medium'].includes($json.relevance) }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.2
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Merge Release Summaries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.aggregate",
      "position": [
        2080,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "aggregate": "aggregateAllItemData",
        "destinationFieldName": "releases"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "d4b0f001-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Post to Microsoft Teams",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "notes": "Paste your Teams Workflows webhook URL here. Treat it like a password.",
      "position": [
        2304,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://YOUR-TEAMS-WORKFLOWS-WEBHOOK-URL",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ type: 'message', attachments: [{ contentType: 'application/vnd.microsoft.card.adaptive', content: { '$schema': 'http://adaptivecards.io/schemas/adaptive-card.json', type: 'AdaptiveCard', version: '1.4', body: [{ type: 'TextBlock', size: 'Medium', weight: 'Bolder', wrap: true, text: 'New competitor press releases (' + $json.releases.length + ')' }].concat($json.releases.flatMap(r => [{ type: 'TextBlock', wrap: true, weight: 'Bolder', spacing: 'Large', separator: true, text: '[' + r.relevance.toUpperCase() + ' / ' + r.category + '] ' + r.company + ' (' + r.date + ')' }, { type: 'TextBlock', wrap: true, text: '[' + r.title + '](' + r.link + ')' }, { type: 'TextBlock', wrap: true, text: r.summary }, { type: 'TextBlock', wrap: true, isSubtle: true, text: 'Why it matters: ' + r.why_it_matters }])) } }] }) }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json"
      },
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "typeVersion": 4.2
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
